    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127340/extras/8b6a343b0ea583a56944ab0e32123a74.webp?t=1753435543\" /></div>Battle for survival in the most accessible hardest game ever (Self proclaimed). Hack and slash your way through nine nights of intense action and at dawn, get your strength back (Sort of).<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127340/extras/0c79e542028cff7b2d73018703a7d302.poster.avif?t=1753435543\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127340/extras/0c79e542028cff7b2d73018703a7d302.webm?t=1753435543\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127340/extras/0c79e542028cff7b2d73018703a7d302.mp4?t=1753435543\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Deceptively simple, DAWN ONE is a neo-arcade game with no checkpoints, no mystery to unravel, no vast land to explore, no trying to understand what that weird skill description means. Fight to survive till DAWN ONE in radically accessible yet hard and unforgiving short 20 minutes loops packed with challenge and excitement. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127340/extras/46cb40ad6620896360356892ca3cf798.poster.avif?t=1753435543\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127340/extras/46cb40ad6620896360356892ca3cf798.webm?t=1753435543\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127340/extras/46cb40ad6620896360356892ca3cf798.mp4?t=1753435543\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127340/extras/8b6a343b0ea583a56944ab0e32123a74.webp?t=1753435543\" /></div>Battle for survival in the most accessible hardest game ever (Self proclaimed). Hack and slash your way through nine nights of intense action and at dawn, get your strength back (Sort of).<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127340/extras/0c79e542028cff7b2d73018703a7d302.poster.avif?t=1753435543\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127340/extras/0c79e542028cff7b2d73018703a7d302.webm?t=1753435543\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127340/extras/0c79e542028cff7b2d73018703a7d302.mp4?t=1753435543\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Deceptively simple, DAWN ONE is a neo-arcade game with no checkpoints, no mystery to unravel, no vast land to explore, no trying to understand what that weird skill description means. Fight to survive till DAWN ONE in radically accessible yet hard and unforgiving short 20 minutes loops packed with challenge and excitement. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127340/extras/46cb40ad6620896360356892ca3cf798.poster.avif?t=1753435543\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127340/extras/46cb40ad6620896360356892ca3cf798.webm?t=1753435543\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2127340/extras/46cb40ad6620896360356892ca3cf798.mp4?t=1753435543\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
